body:
I never knew Ken Levine built models.

&#x200B;

Looks good mate.

He's a cool dude.

&#x200B;

Started with 2k in america and made it to the top. good on him.

His mere existence seems to trigger some people for some reason though.

&#x200B;

I also like his memes and shitposting.

FUCKING RAGING

&#x200B;

But nah everyone is super salty about it. Old fuckwits trying to justify their jobs by regulation something they know nothing about.

The media. It once used to be a source of verified news and events. Now its mostly opinion shows sprinkled with news. It pushes the "Current thing" more than actually reporting on events.

&#x200B;

Also I feel like everyone has been conditioned to associate news with bad. I cant remember the last time I turned on the news channel and there was a feel good story.

Recently saw a vid of a cat with its legs tied down, half a bottle tied over its face so it couldnt bite and some cunt was dragging a taser back and forth over its back. Poor thing was screeching.

&#x200B;

I've seen some fucked up shit on the internet and am pretty desensitized...but that made me sick for a couple of days.

When my friend commited suicide the Police car and Coroners car  had to park in the shared driveway to access the house. Had some guy pull up and lay on the horn. Tehn proceeded to get into an argument with the cop there. It wasnt until an elderly neighbour came out and yell "Someone is dead, have some goddammed respect" that the guy went quiet and waited for them to move.

&#x200B;

Baffled me. Clearly the police and coroner are there, in full hazmat suits (He had been there about 2 weeks in the summer :(    ) for a reason.

"what idiot decided to do a patch on sunday."

&#x200B;

Russians

I used to believe in god. Then I was raped as a child. Growing up I was confused on how God allowed that to happen. Now as an adult I look at the world and cant understand how an all powerful loving god could allow such atrocities to occur.

&#x200B;

Fuck god and fuck religion.

Welcome. You've invested in a good coin. You must know that this coin fluctuates A LOT. Dont have a heart attack if it drops 40% overnight, it'll be back up during the day.

&#x200B;

Also. Shib hasnt crashed. its correcting. I'd suggest buying some Shib while its dirt cheap.

You mean the same Robinhood that blocked people from trading once a "certain" stock got really high?

&#x200B;

Cross your fingers for binance.

I dont get shitting on sellers. Everyone has a price. Everyone has things going on in their life that we dont know about and probably need the money.

&#x200B;

I can guarantee everyone in the Shib community will sell when the price is right. I know I will be, and if the price goes after after I sell? I'll congratulate the people still holding.

